---
title: contrai-scraper — deployment on a shared homelab host (Compose, VPN sidecar)
---
flowchart LR
    subgraph Host["Debian 13 host, shared with the homelab"]
        direction TB
        subgraph Netns["one network namespace, owned by the vpn container"]
            direction TB
            Scraper["scraper container<br/>contrai-scrape run · headless Chromium<br/>uid 10001 · egress gate before each session and hop"]
            Vpn["vpn container · gluetun<br/>WireGuard tun0 · firewall kill switch<br/>DNS over TLS inside the tunnel"]
            Scraper -- "its only route: tun0" --> Vpn
        end
        Etc[/"/etc/contrai<br/>profile.toml · env files · wg0.conf"/]
        Records[("/var/lib/contrai/records<br/>games/ · raw/ · verdicts/")]
        Homelab["Nextcloud · Vikunja · Cockpit · Tailscale<br/>untouched, on their own routes"]
        Etc -. "read-only mounts" .-> Scraper
        Etc -. "wg0.conf" .-> Vpn
        Scraper --> Records
    end

    Vpn == "encrypted UDP, to the VPN endpoint only" ==> Wan(["home WAN"])
    Homelab --> Wan
    Wan ==> Exit(["VPN exit, France"])
    Exit ==> Site(["the target site"])
    Laptop(["dev laptop"]) -. "SSH or Tailscale: records, logs" .-> Records

